  <h2>The waitlist and founding spots</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Joining the waitlist is free and creates no obligation to use Good Circles at launch.</li>
    <li>Founding designations are limited — the first 200 Mississippi businesses become Founding Merchants and the first 50 nonprofits become Founding Nonprofits. Spots are allocated in signup order among qualifying organizations.</li>
    <li>Waitlist position and invite codes are for personal use and may not be sold.</li>
    <li>No payment is collected, and no purchase is possible, before launch.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Accuracy of what we say</h2>
  <p>
    Figures on this site describe how the Good Circles model works: shoppers save about 10% on
    local purchases, a chosen nonprofit receives 10% of the merchant's net profit on each sale,
    and merchants keep 89% of profit on a 1% platform fee. Exact amounts on a given sale depend on
    the item and merchant. External "bridge" items carry no shopper discount; a share of that
    commission funds a pooled nonprofit fund.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
